# PRODUCTION uchun ildiz .env namunasi (rizqim.uz, alohida serverda): cp .env.production.example .env
# Bu .env.example ning production nusxasi: domenlar, edge va avtomatik deploy qiymatlari qo'shilgan. Qolgan kalitlarning
# ma'nosi .env.example da va docs/DEPLOY.md da. Production'da docker-compose.staging.yml ISHLATILMAYDI.
# docker-compose.yml shu faylni ./.env dan avtomatik o'qiydi.

# Shu qator tufayli `docker compose ...` hamma fayllar bilan ishlaydi (-f yozish shart emas): asosiy + edge (80/443, avtomatik
# TLS) + images (GHCR'dan tayyor obrazlar; GitHub Actions deploy.yml va infra/deploy/deploy.sh ishlatadi).
# Serverda yig'ish (build) kerak bo'lsa oxirgi faylni olib tashlang. docs/DEPLOY.md, 11-bo'lim.
COMPOSE_FILE=docker-compose.yml:docker-compose.edge.yml:docker-compose.images.yml

# --- Domenlar va edge (docker-compose.edge.yml, infra/edge/Caddyfile) ---
# Asosiy domen rizqim.uz (rizqim.com va rizq.im unga yo'naltiriladi: infra/edge/conf.d/aliases.caddy.example).
# DNS: A yozuvlari rizqim.uz, www, app, api, business, admin, pos, links -> production server IP'si (docs/SERVER_SETUP.md).
#   rizqim.uz            landing                      app.rizqim.uz       Telegram Mini App
#   api.rizqim.uz        backend API + WebSocket      business.rizqim.uz  hamkor paneli
#   admin.rizqim.uz      boshqaruv markazi            pos.rizqim.uz       POS ilovalarini yuklab olish
#   links.rizqim.uz      vaqtincha sahifa
EDGE_DOMAIN=rizqim.uz
EDGE_PROFILE=production
# Let's Encrypt ogohlantirishlari uchun e-pochta (sertifikat muddati haqida)
EDGE_ACME_EMAIL=
# admin.rizqim.uz ni IP bilan cheklash (ixtiyoriy, tavsiya etiladi): docs/SERVER_SETUP.md. Bo'sh = cheklovsiz
# Ro'yxat: cp infra/edge/admin/allow.caddy.example infra/edge/admin/allow.caddy (conf.d/ ga EMAS). IPv6 bilan kirsangiz
# IPv6 manzilingizni ham yozing. Admin API api.<domen> va app.<domen> da baribir yopiq (infra/edge/Caddyfile)
# EDGE_ADMIN_ACCESS=/etc/caddy/admin/allow.caddy

# --- Avtomatik deploy (infra/deploy/deploy.sh yozadi/yangilaydi: IMAGE_PREFIX, IMAGE_TAG, IMAGE_TAG_*; qo'lda tegmang) ---
# Fayllar .deploy/releases/<tag>/ ga keladi; deploy.sh ularni tekshiruvlardan keyin shu papkaga ko'chiradi (docs/DEPLOY.md, 11-bo'lim)
# Mini App obrazi muhit bo'yicha alohida yig'iladi: shu serverda production
DEPLOY_TARGET=production
# Deploy tugagach ommaviy manzilni ham tekshirish: warn (standart, faqat ogohlantiradi) yoki required (xato bo'lsa orqaga qaytaradi)
# DEPLOY_PUBLIC_CHECK=warn
# Production'da deploy migratsiyadan oldin zaxira oladi (backup xizmati ishlamasa va bazada ma'lumot bo'lsa deploy RAD ETILADI).
# DEPLOY_BACKUP=0 buni o'chiradi: tavsiya etilmaydi
# DEPLOY_BACKUP=1

DB_DATABASE=rizqimbot
DB_USERNAME=rizqimbot
DB_PASSWORD=CHANGE_ME_production_db_password
# M4 baza rollari (docs/OPERATIONS.md, «Baza rollari»). Bo'sh = bitta rol (DB_USERNAME hammasini qiladi, avvalgidek).
# Ajratilganda: POSTGRES_USER/POSTGRES_PASSWORD = bootstrap superuser (mavjud o'rnatishda: ESKI DB_USERNAME/DB_PASSWORD,
# faqat postgres, backup, db-roles); DB_USERNAME/DB_PASSWORD = rizqim_app (faqat ma'lumot; php-fpm, queue, scheduler,
# reverb, PgBouncer); DB_OWNER_USERNAME/DB_OWNER_PASSWORD = rizqim_owner (jadvallar egasi: migratsiyalar va
# db:partitions:*; faqat backend va scheduler konteynerlariga beriladi). Parollar har xil bo'lsin. Bu kalitlarni
# backend/.env ga YOZMANG (u hamma konteynerga, php-fpm ga ham tushadi): faqat shu ildiz .env da.
# POSTGRES_USER=rizqimbot
# POSTGRES_PASSWORD=secret
# DB_OWNER_USERNAME=rizqim_owner
# DB_OWNER_PASSWORD=
# M4 3-bosqich, qator darajasidagi himoya (RLS; docs/OPERATIONS.md, 24-bo'lim). Faqat rollar ajratilganda (yuqorida).
# TENANT_RLS=1: do'kon so'rovining (kassa, panel) har tranzaksiyasi rizqim_tenant roli bilan ishlaydi va PostgreSQL boshqa
# do'konning pul qatorlarini o'zi rad etadi. Bo'sh yoki 0 = o'chiq, hammasi avvalgidek. Avval kodni TENANT_RLS'siz
# joylang (db-roles rolni yaratadi, migratsiya siyosatlarni qo'yadi), keyin yoqing. O'chirish: TENANT_RLS=0, docker compose up -d
# TENANT_RLS=1
# DB_TENANT_ROLE=rizqim_tenant

# Ulanishlar puli (pgbouncer xizmati): php-fpm Postgres'ga PgBouncer orqali (tranzaksiya rejimi). Bo'sh = standart.
# DB_POOLER=direct pulni o'chiradi (avvalgidek to'g'ridan-to'g'ri). Hisob va kuzatish: docs/OPERATIONS.md, 12-bo'lim
# PGBOUNCER_MAX_DB_CONNECTIONS + ~15 (to'g'ridan-to'g'ri xizmatlar) + 3 Postgres max_connections (100) dan kam bo'lsin.
# DB_POOLER=pgbouncer
# PGBOUNCER_POOL_SIZE=20
# PGBOUNCER_RESERVE_POOL_SIZE=5
# PGBOUNCER_MAX_DB_CONNECTIONS=30
# PGBOUNCER_MAX_CLIENT_CONN=1000
# PGBOUNCER_QUERY_WAIT_TIMEOUT=30

# Redis (kesh, navbat, sessiya, rate-limit): compose'dagi `redis` xizmati. REDIS_HOST=redis va REDIS_PORT=6379 ni
# docker-compose.yml o'zi beradi (backend/.env dagi 127.0.0.1 ni bekor qiladi), shuning uchun bu yerda faqat parol.
# PRODUCTION'DA SHART: bo'sh yoki CHANGE_ME bo'lsa deploy.sh ishga tushmaydi (Redis tashqariga ochilmagan, lekin compose
# tarmog'idagi har konteyner unga ulana oladi). Redis ham, backend/queue/scheduler ham shu parolni ishlatadi (backend/.env dagi
# REDIS_PASSWORD o'rniga). Yaratish: openssl rand -hex 24. Parolda $ bo'lmasin.
REDIS_PASSWORD=CHANGE_ME_production_redis_password
# Redis xotira chegarasi (noeviction): yetganda yozuv rad etiladi; used_memory chegaraning 80 foizidan oshsa ogohlantiring.
REDIS_MAXMEMORY=1gb

# Real-time buyurtma holatlari (Laravel Reverb, compose'dagi `reverb` xizmati). M2: standart bo'yicha yoqiq. Quyidagi uchta
# kalit bo'sh qolsa, backend konteyneri ularni birinchi ishga tushishda o'zi yaratadi va saqlaydi (backend_storage
# volume'i, storage/app/.realtime/reverb.env, faqat root o'qiydi; qiymatlar logga chiqmaydi). Ilovalar kalitni
# GET /api/v1/realtime dan oladi. O'zingiz bermoqchi bo'lsangiz (masalan Mini App build'iga VITE_REVERB_APP_KEY
# bilan): REVERB_APP_ID=$(openssl rand -hex 4), REVERB_APP_KEY=$(openssl rand -hex 16),
# REVERB_APP_SECRET=$(openssl rand -hex 32); bu yerda berilgan kalitlar har doim ustun. KEY'ni o'zgartirgandan keyin:
# docker compose up -d --build (frontend ham). Rollback: BROADCAST_CONNECTION=null (yoki log) real-time'ni o'chiradi,
# ilovalar so'rov bilan yangilanishda davom etadi. docs/DEPLOY.md, 9-bo'lim
BROADCAST_CONNECTION=reverb
REVERB_APP_ID=
REVERB_APP_KEY=
REVERB_APP_SECRET=
# WebSocket ochishga ruxsat etilgan hostlar (Origin), vergul bilan; * = hammasi (app:check-production ogohlantiradi).
# Yozing: Mini App hosti, hamkor paneli hosti (business.<domen>: panel doskasi real-time'i) va API hosti (oshxona ekrani —
# KDS ilovasi Origin sifatida RIZQIM_API_URL hostini yuboradi; odatda Mini App hosti bilan bir xil, alohida bo'lsa uni
# ham qo'shing). Ro'yxatda bo'lmagan host rad etiladi (4009) va o'sha ekran jim, faqat polling bilan ishlaydi.
# Scheme'siz: Mini App, hamkor paneli, API hosti. docs/DEPLOY.md, 9-bo'lim
REVERB_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=app.rizqim.uz,business.rizqim.uz,api.rizqim.uz

# Hamma ichki port 127.0.0.1 da (deploy tekshiruvi shu portlardan); tashqaridan faqat edge (80/443)
BACKEND_PORT=8000
# Backend porti (API, /up) qaysi manzilda ochiladi: standart 127.0.0.1 (faqat shu xostdagi tashqi proksi).
# Backend xususiy tarmoqdan kelgan X-Forwarded-For ga ishonadi: port internetga ochiq bo'lsa (Docker userland proksisi,
# IPv6) kishi IP'sini soxtalashtirib kirish limitlarini aylanib o'tardi. Proksi boshqa xostda bo'lsa o'zgartiring va
# portni firewall bilan yoping. docs/OPERATIONS.md, 10-bo'lim
# BACKEND_BIND=127.0.0.1
FRONTEND_PORT=8080

# POS ilovalarini yuklab olish sahifasi (compose'dagi `pos-site`, infra/pos-site): tashqi proksi pos.<domen> ni POS_SITE_PORT ga beradi.
# Ilova fayllari POS_FILES_DIR papkasida (<ilova>/<platforma>/fayl), faqat o'qish uchun ulanadi. docs/OPERATIONS.md, "POS ilovalarini chiqarish"
POS_SITE_PORT=8090
# POS_SITE_BIND=127.0.0.1
# POS_FILES_DIR=./pos-files

# rizqim.uz landing (compose'dagi `landing`, infra/landing): tashqi proksi rizqim.uz ni LANDING_PORT ga beradi. Matn va aloqa: infra/landing/site/site.config.js
LANDING_PORT=8091
# LANDING_BIND=127.0.0.1

# Hamkor veb-panel (compose'dagi `partner-web`, partner/web). Edge (docker-compose.edge.yml) business.<domen> ni PARTNER_WEB_PORT ga beradi.
# PARTNER_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL: brauzer API'ga shu manzil orqali murojaat qiladi ("/api" bilan tugaydi; odatda Mini App
# domenidagi /api, uni frontend backend'ga uzatadi). Bo'sh qolsa panel ishlamaydi (ichki http://backend/api brauzerga
# ko'rinmaydi). Panel origin'i backend/.env dagi CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS da bo'lishi shart. docs/DEPLOY.md, 4-bo'lim
PARTNER_WEB_PORT=3000
# Port qaysi manzilda ochiladi: standart 127.0.0.1 (faqat shu xostdagi tashqi proksi). Panel mijoz IP'sini proksi yozgan
# X-Forwarded-For dan oladi, shuning uchun port proksini chetlab internetga ochilmasin. docs/DEPLOY.md, 4-bo'lim
# PARTNER_WEB_BIND=127.0.0.1
# Brauzer API'ga api.rizqim.uz orqali boradi; panel origin'i (https://business.rizqim.uz) backend/.env dagi CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS da.
# Real-time: PARTNER_REVERB_HOST bo'sh = API hosti (wss://api.rizqim.uz/app/...)
PARTNER_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=https://api.rizqim.uz/api
# Sessiya cookie'larida Secure (faqat HTTPS). false faqat http:// orqali sinab ko'rishda
PARTNER_SESSION_COOKIE_SECURE=true
# Panel doskasi uchun real-time yuqoridagi REVERB_APP_KEY bilan ishlaydi; host bo'sh = PARTNER_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL host'i
# PARTNER_REVERB_HOST=
# PARTNER_REVERB_PORT=443
# PARTNER_REVERB_SCHEME=https
# Hududlar xaritasi: production'da hisobli plitka provayderi (bo'sh = ochiq OSM, faqat sinov uchun)
# PARTNER_MAP_TILE_URL=https://tiles.example.com/{z}/{x}/{y}.png
# PARTNER_MAP_ATTRIBUTION= — HTML sifatida chiqadi (havola bo'lishi mumkin): faqat o'zingiz yozgan, ishonchli matn

# DIQQAT: avtomatik deploy'da (docker-compose.images.yml) Mini App obrazi GitHub Actions'da yig'iladi: VITE_* qiymatlari bu fayldan
# EMAS, repozitoriy Variables'idan olinadi (PROD_VITE_BOT_USERNAME, PROD_VITE_PARTNER_WEB_URL, PROD_VITE_MAP_TILE_URL,
# PROD_VITE_MAP_ATTRIBUTION, PROD_VITE_SENTRY_DSN; docs/SERVER_SETUP.md). Quyidagilar serverda yig'iladigan (build) holat uchun.
VITE_BOT_USERNAME=rizqimbot
# Nisbiy: Mini App app.rizqim.uz da ochiladi va /api/ ni o'z nginx'i backend'ga uzatadi (same-origin, CORS kerak emas)
VITE_API_URL=/api/v1
# Mini App xodim ekranlaridagi "Web panelda tahrirlash" havolasi: hamkor paneli manzili, masalan https://business.rizqim.uz
# (build vaqtida; o'zgartirgandan keyin docker compose up -d --build frontend). Bo'sh = havolasiz, faqat matn
# RIZQIM boshqaruv markazi (compose'dagi `platform-admin`, platform/admin): admin.<domen> ni ADMIN_WEB_PORT ga bering.
# Brauzer backend'ga ilovaning o'z manzili orqali murojaat qiladi: CORS va API manzili kerak emas. Port standart bo'yicha
# faqat 127.0.0.1 da (partner-web kabi, IP limitlari uchun). docs/DEPLOY.md, 4-bo'lim, «RIZQIM boshqaruv markazi»
ADMIN_WEB_PORT=3100
# ADMIN_WEB_BIND=127.0.0.1
# Sessiya cookie'sida Secure (faqat HTTPS). false faqat http:// orqali sinab ko'rishda
ADMIN_SESSION_COOKIE_SECURE=true
# Hamkor paneli manzili (xodim ekranlaridagi "Web panelda tahrirlash" havolasi)
VITE_PARTNER_WEB_URL=https://business.rizqim.uz

# Mini App xaritasi (build vaqtida o'rnatiladi, o'zgartirgandan keyin: docker compose up -d --build frontend).
# Bo'sh qoldirilsa OpenStreetMap'ning ochiq tile serveri ishlatiladi: u FAQAT ishlab chiqish va kam trafik uchun
# (OSM tile usage policy). Productionda akkauntingiz bor provayder yoki o'z tile serveringizni bering, masalan
# https://tiles.example.com/{z}/{x}/{y}.png, va o'sha provayder talab qiladigan attribution (HTML) ni. Attribution
# xaritada HTML sifatida chiqadi (escape qilinmaydi): bu yerga faqat o'zingiz yozgan, ishonchli matn qo'ying.
VITE_MAP_TILE_URL=
VITE_MAP_ATTRIBUTION=

# Mini App'ning Reverb ulanishi (build vaqtida; o'zgartirgandan keyin docker compose up -d --build frontend).
# VITE_REVERB_APP_KEY bo'sh bo'lsa REVERB_APP_KEY olinadi. Host bo'sh = Mini App domeni: WebSocket shu origin'dagi
# /app/ orqali (customer/miniapp/docker/nginx.conf -> reverb:8080). Port/scheme brauzer ko'radigan tashqi HTTPS (443/https).
VITE_REVERB_APP_KEY=
VITE_REVERB_HOST=
VITE_REVERB_PORT=443
VITE_REVERB_SCHEME=https

# Mini App Sentry (build vaqtida o'rnatiladi: docker compose up -d --build frontend). VITE_SENTRY_DSN bo'sh bo'lsa
# Sentry yuklanmaydi ham, hech narsa yuborilmaydi. Backend uchun SENTRY_LARAVEL_DSN backend/.env da. docs/OPERATIONS.md
VITE_SENTRY_DSN=
VITE_SENTRY_ENVIRONMENT=production
# Deploy versiyasi (masalan git sha); backend'dagi SENTRY_RELEASE bilan bir xil bo'lsin
VITE_SENTRY_RELEASE=
VITE_SENTRY_TRACES_SAMPLE_RATE=0

# Zaxira nusxa (docker compose'dagi `backup` xizmati, scripts/backup.sh): har kuni BACKUP_TIME (UTC) da pg_dump.
# Fayllar BACKUP_HOST_DIR papkasiga tushadi (serverda; serverdan tashqariga ham nusxalang: BACKUP_S3_* quyida).
BACKUP_HOST_DIR=./backups
# UTC; 21:30 = Toshkent 02:30 (savdo yo'q payt). Shu vaqtda ketma-ket: PITR zaxirasi (yoqilgan bo'lsa), pg_dump, jurnallar arxivi
BACKUP_TIME=21:30
BACKUP_RETENTION_DAYS=14
# Server tashqarisiga nusxa, S3-mos xotiraga (AWS S3, Cloudflare R2, Backblaze B2, MinIO): to'rt qiymat (endpoint, bucket,
# kalit, maxfiy kalit) to'ldirilsa har bir muvaffaqiyatli dump (va .sha256) rclone bilan yuklanadi (`backup` obrazida bor).
# Hammasi bo'sh = o'chiq. Bucket oldindan yaratilgan bo'lsin; eski nusxalarni bucket lifecycle qoidasi bilan o'chiring
# (docs/OPERATIONS.md, 4-bo'lim): qoida FAQAT prefiks ildizidagi rizqim-*.dump fayllariga bo'lsin, pitr/ va archive/
# papkalariga emas. Kalitga o'chirish huquqini bermang. Parolda $ bo'lmasin.
BACKUP_S3_ENDPOINT=
BACKUP_S3_BUCKET=
BACKUP_S3_ACCESS_KEY=
BACKUP_S3_SECRET=
# Ixtiyoriy: region (masalan auto, eu-central-1), bucket ichidagi papka (rizqim/production) va, lifecycle o'rniga,
# S3 dagi shu kundan eski dump'larni o'chirish (kalitda o'chirish huquqi kerak; faqat prefiks ildizidagi rizqim-*.dump
# fayllariga tegadi, pitr/ va archive/ ga hech qachon)
BACKUP_S3_REGION=
BACKUP_S3_PREFIX=
BACKUP_S3_RETENTION_DAYS=
# Ixtiyoriy: har bir zaxiradan keyin bajariladigan buyruq, fayl yo'li $BACKUP_FILE da. Bitta qo'shtirnoq SHART (aks holda
# compose $BACKUP_FILE ni o'zi almashtirib yuboradi). S3 o'rniga o'zingizning vositangiz kerak bo'lsa (rclone `backup` obrazida bor):
#   BACKUP_OFFSITE_CMD='rclone copy "$BACKUP_FILE" remote:rizqim-backups'
BACKUP_OFFSITE_CMD=

# Uzluksiz zaxira (PITR, pgBackRest; docker compose'dagi `postgres` va `backup`). Yoqilsa istalgan daqiqaga (oxirgi ~14 kun
# shu serverda, ~28 kun S3 da) tiklash mumkin, yo'qotish oynasi ~1-2 daqiqa. 1 = yoqiq; bo'sh yoki 0 = o'chiq (avvalgidek).
# Yoqgandan keyin: docker compose up -d --build (Postgres bir marta qayta ishga tushadi). docs/OPERATIONS.md, «Uzluksiz zaxira (PITR)»
PITR_ENABLED=1
# Tashqi "o'lik odam" kuzatuvi (healthchecks.io bepul hisob): scheduler har daqiqada shu manzilga so'rov yuboradi; so'rovlar
# 5 daqiqadan ko'p to'xtasa, healthchecks.io egaga Telegram/email yuboradi. Bo'sh = yuborilmaydi. docs/OPERATIONS.md
HEALTHCHECKS_PING_URL=
# S3 dagi PITR nusxasining shifrlash paroli (AES-256). S3 sozlangan bo'lsa SHART, aks holda S3 ga PITR yozilmaydi.
# Yaratish: openssl rand -base64 48. Parolni server TASHQARISIDA (parol menejerida) saqlang: yo'qolsa S3 dagi
# nusxalarni hech kim o'qiy olmaydi. Keyin o'zgartirmang (eski zaxiralar eski parol bilan). Parolda $ bo'lmasin.
PITR_CIPHER_PASS=
# PITR uchun S3: bo'sh = yuqoridagi BACKUP_S3_* (bucket ichida <BACKUP_S3_PREFIX>/pitr papkasi). Endpoint https:// bilan.
# XAVFSIZ TARTIB: pgBackRest eski nusxalarni o'zi o'chiradi (kalitga o'chirish huquqi kerak), jurnallar arxivi esa
# hech qachon o'chmasligi kerak. Shuning uchun PITR uchun ALOHIDA kalit (yaxshisi alohida bucket) bering, arxivga esa
# o'chirish huquqisiz kalit (ARCHIVE_S3_*, pastda). pitr/ va archive/ papkalariga bucket lifecycle qoidasi qo'ymang.
# PITR_S3_ENDPOINT=
# PITR_S3_BUCKET=
# PITR_S3_ACCESS_KEY=
# PITR_S3_SECRET=
# PITR_S3_REGION=us-east-1
# PITR_S3_PREFIX=
# path (MinIO, R2, B2, AWS) yoki host
# PITR_S3_URI_STYLE=path
# Nechta to'liq zaxira saqlanadi (haftalik): shu serverda 2 (~14 kun), S3 da 4 (~28 kun)
# PITR_REPO1_RETENTION_FULL=2
# PITR_S3_RETENTION_FULL=4
# Arxiv nishoni (S3) ishlamay qolsa shu hajmgacha WAL navbatda kutadi; oshsa WAL tashlanadi (disk to'lmaydi, lekin PITR
# zanjiri uziladi va Monitoring ogohlantiradi; keyingi to'liq zaxira uni tiklaydi)
# PITR_ARCHIVE_QUEUE_MAX=4GiB
# Tiklash mashqi: har oy birinchi yakshanba shu vaqtda (UTC) avtomatik. 0 = faqat qo'lda (scripts/restore-drill.sh)
# PITR_DRILL_MONTHLY=1
# PITR_DRILL_TIME=23:00
# Ixtiyoriy: har muvaffaqiyatli PITR zaxirasidan keyin ping (healthchecks.io dead-man), masalan https://hc-ping.com/<uuid>
# PITR_PING_URL=
# Jurnallar arxivi uchun S3 (fiskal va audit cheklari arxivi, HECH QACHON o'chmaydi). Bo'sh = BACKUP_S3_* (<prefix>/archive).
# Tavsiya: o'chirish huquqi YO'Q alohida kalit va imkon bo'lsa Object Lock / versiyalash yoqilgan alohida bucket.
# archive-partitions.sh har kecha kalit o'chira oladimi tekshiradi va o'chira olsa logda DIQQAT yozadi (markazda ham)
# ARCHIVE_S3_ENDPOINT=
# ARCHIVE_S3_BUCKET=
# ARCHIVE_S3_ACCESS_KEY=
# ARCHIVE_S3_SECRET=
# ARCHIVE_S3_REGION=
# ARCHIVE_S3_PREFIX=
# Jurnallar arxivi (eski oylar, scripts/archive-partitions.sh): S3 (ARCHIVE_S3_* / BACKUP_S3_*) bo'lmasa fayllar faqat shu serverda
# qoladi va bazadan HECH NARSA o'chirilmaydi (S3 siz o'chirishga ruxsat: backend/.env da ARCHIVE_ALLOW_LOCAL_ONLY=1, tavsiya etilmaydi)
# Faqat PITR'dan tiklangan nusxani ish bazasi qilish runbook'ida (docs/OPERATIONS.md): xostdagi mutlaq papka yo'li.
# Bo'sh = postgres_data volume'i (odatdagi holat, o'zgartirmang)
# POSTGRES_DATA_VOLUME=

# Production uchun majburiy qiymatlar. Backend konteyneri ularni backend/.env dan (env_file) o'qiydi,
# entrypoint esa boshqacha bo'lsa ishga tushmaydi. Lokal ishlab chiqishda: APP_ENV=local, APP_DEBUG=true
APP_ENV=production
APP_DEBUG=false
TELEGRAM_ALLOW_MOCK_AUTH=false
SMS_EXPOSE_CODE_IN_RESPONSE=false

# Kesh, navbat va sessiya Redis'da (production standarti); backend konteyneri ularni ham backend/.env dan o'qiydi
# (bu yerda eslatma sifatida). 'database' drayveri zaxira variant bo'lib qoladi: Redis'siz ishlash uchun uchalasini
# ham database qiling. Database-navbatdan o'tishdan oldin uni bo'shating: php artisan queue:work database --stop-when-empty
CACHE_STORE=redis
QUEUE_CONNECTION=redis
SESSION_DRIVER=redis
REDIS_CLIENT=phpredis

# Faqat SuperAdminSeeder uchun (backend/.env): productionda majburiy, parol kamida 12 belgi
SUPERADMIN_EMAIL=
SUPERADMIN_PASSWORD=
